  "Each phase, you can re-roll 1 hit roll, or 1 wound roll, or 1 save roll for this unit.": "",
  "If this unit charged this turn, pick an enemy unit in combat with it to be the target.": "Si esta unidad ha cargado este turno, elige como objetivo una unidad enemiga en combate con ella.",
  "If this unit charged this turn, pick an enemy unit in combat with it to be the target.": "",
  "Roll a D3. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.": "Tira un D3. Con un 2+, inflige al objetivo una cantidad de daño mortal igual al resultado.",
  "Pick 1 of your hero's melee weapons. Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of that weapon.": "",
