  "Add 2 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's melee weapons for the rest of the turn.": "Añade 2 a la característica de Attacks de las armas de combate de esta unidad durante el resto del turno.",
  "Once Per Turn, Reaction: You declared a **^^Relentless Discipline^^** ability for this unit": "",
  "Pick any number of visible friendly units wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the targets.": "",
  "Add 1 to the number of dice rolled when making charge rolls for this unit, to a maximum of 3.": "",
  "Pick a visible enemy **^^Hero^^** or **^^Monster^^** in combat with this unit to be the target.": "Elige como objetivo un **^^Hero^^** o **^^Monster^^** enemigo visible en combate con esta unidad.",
  "Roll a dice for each target. On a 3+, the target has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Subtract 1 from the Attacks characteristic of the target's melee weapons for the rest of the turn.": "Resta 1 a la característica de Attacks de las armas de cuerpo a cuerpo del objetivo durante el resto del turno.",
  "Subtract 1 from ward rolls for enemy units while they are within 12\" of this **^^Manifestation^^**.": "",
  "Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase, Reaction: You declared a **^^Fight^^** ability for this unit": "",
  "Pick a friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers Wizard^^** wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Pick a visible enemy unit within 18\" of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "Pick a visible enemy unit within 12\" of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "Elige como objetivo una unidad enemiga visible a 12\" o menos de esta unidad y después haz una tirada de lanzamiento de 2D6.",
  "For the rest of the phase, this unit can use that ability as if it had the **^^Unlimited^^** keyword.": "",
  "Once Per Turn, Reaction: Opponent declared a **^^Spell^^** ability for a unit within 18\" of this unit": "",
  "If this unit is in combat, pick a visible enemy **^^Hero^^** within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero^^** non-**^^Unique Death^^** unit that has been destroyed to be the target.": "Elige como objetivo una unidad amiga **^^Death^^** que no sea **^^Hero^^** ni **^^Unique^^** y que haya sido destruida.",
  "Subtract 10 from the control scores of enemy units while they are within 6\" of this **^^Manifestation^^**.": "",
  "While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of **Razarak's Ebon Claws** is 3.": "Mientras esta unidad tenga 10 o más puntos de daño, la característica de Attacks de **Razarak's Ebon Claws** es 3.",
  "Subtract 1 from wound rolls for combat attacks that target this unit if it did not charge in the same turn.": "",
  "Subtract 1 from wound rolls for combat attacks made by enemy units while they are in combat with this unit.": "",
  "This unit can only use this ability if at least half the units from your starting army have been destroyed.": "",
  "**The following universal terrain abilities apply to this terrain feature (Terrain, 1.2):\r\nCover, Unstable**": "**Las siguientes habilidades universales de escenografía se aplican a este elemento de escenografía (Terrain, 1.2):\nCover, Unstable**",
  "Pick a visible enemy **^^Hero^^** within 18\" of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "If this unit is not in combat, pick a friendly **Mortek Guard**unit that has been destroyed to be the target.": "",
  "While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Crushing Appendages** is 5.": "",
  "While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the number after its **^^Relentless Discipline^^** keyword is 4.": "",
  "Double this unit's control score while it is contesting an objective that is wholly outside friendly territory.": "",
  "If this unit has a Health characteristic of 1, return D3 slain models to it. Otherwise, **Heal (3)** this unit.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, add 1 to the Rend characteristic of the target's weapons until the start of your next turn.": "",
  "If there are no enemy units within 6\" of this unit, pick a terrain feature within 3\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "If this unit's **Nohem** is on the battlefield, pick a visible enemy unit within 18\" of this unit to be the target.": "Si el **Nohem** de esta unidad está en el campo de batalla, elige como objetivo una unidad enemiga visible a 18\" o menos de esta unidad.",
  "Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Ossiarch Bonereapers Cavalry^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Set up a replacement unit identical to the target wholly within 12\" of this unit and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "Coloca una unidad de reemplazo idéntica al objetivo totalmente a 12\" o menos de esta unidad y a más de 9\" de todas las unidades enemigas.",
  "Add 2 to run rolls for visible friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** units while they are wholly within 12\" of this unit.": "",
  "If your hero has a **Nightmarish Ossiarch** War Form, you can pick this upgrade.\r\nAdd 2\" to your hero's Move characteristic.": "",
  "For the rest of the phase, subtract 1 from the Rend characteristic of weapons used for attacks that target that friendly unit.": "",
  "Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again wholly within 3\" of the target and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "If an enemy **^^Hero^^** was destroyed by this unit's combat attacks this turn, your opponent must reduce their **fury level** to 0.": "",
  "If this unit is **full**, pick a visible friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "If this unit is not in combat, pick a friendly **Mortek Guard**  or **Mortek Triaxes** unit that has been destroyed to be the target.": "",
  "Other than the **Companion** weapon ability, weapon abilities for the target's combat attacks have no effect for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Inflict D3 mortal damage on the target. Then, you can remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again within 1\" of the target.": "",
  "This unit can move 3\". If it can move into combat, it must. If it was in combat at the start of the move, it must end that move in combat.": "",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** unit wholly within 12\" of the caster to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** unit wholly within 12\" of the caster to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "Spend 1 **relentless discipline** point for each target. The targets' melee weapons have **Anti-charge (+1 Rend)** for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Set up a replacement unit with half the number of models from the target unit (rounding up) wholly within 12\" of this unit and not in combat.": "",
  "If your hero has a **Guardian of the Empire** war form, you can pick this upgrade.\r\nAdd the 'Peerless Leader' ability to your hero's warscroll.": "",
  "The target cannot be picked to be the target of or be affected by any non-**^^Core^^** abilities used by other enemy units for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Add 3 to the control scores of visible friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** units that have used any **^^Relentless Discipline^^** abilities this turn.": "",
  "Return 1 slain model to the target unit. If the target has a Health characteristic of 1, return 3 slain models to it instead. Then, this unit is **empty**.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, add 3 to the Rend characteristic of this unit's melee weapons. All of this unit's attacks this turn must target the same enemy unit.": "",
  "If this unit is in combat, pick this unit and up to 2 visible friendly **Kavalos War Chariots** wholly within 12\" of this unit and in combat to be the targets.": "",
  "Add 1 to casting rolls for this unit. Each time this unit successfully casts a spell, **Heal (1)** this unit after that **^^Spell^^** ability has been resolved.": "",
  "Pick a friendly **Mortek Crawler**, **Gothizzar Harvester**, **Morghast Archai** or **Morghast Harbingers** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Set up a replacement unit with half the number of models from the target unit (rounding up) wholly within 12\" of this unit and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "Coloca una unidad de repuesto con la mitad de miniaturas de la unidad objetivo (redondeando hacia arriba) totalmente a 12\" o menos de esta unidad y a más de 9\" de todas las unidades enemigas.",
  "This unit has **^^Ward (3+)^^** against damage points inflicted by **^^Spell^^** abilities, **^^Prayer^^** abilities and abilities used by **^^Manifestations^^**.": "",
  "Each time a friendly non-**^^Hero Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit uses the 'Rally' command, you can make 3 additional rally rolls of D6.": "",
  "This unit and visible friendly **Kavalos Deathriders** units wholly within 12\" Of this unit can move 12\" instead of 10\" when they use the 'Deathrider Wedge' ability.": "",
  "Once Per Phase (Army), Reaction: Opponent declared an **^^Attack^^** ability that targeted a visible **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** unit within this unit's combat range.": "",
  "Your hero has the **^^Fly^^** keyword and their Move characteristic is 12\".\r\nIf your hero has a **Towering War Construct** War Form, this upgrade costs 6 DP instead of 4 DP.": "",
  "Once Per Phase (Army), Reaction: A friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers War Machine^^** or **^^Wizard^^**within this unit's combat range was targeted by an **^^Attack^^** ability": "",
  "Enemy units cannot be set up within **X**\" Of this terrain feature, where **X** is determined by the current battle round, as follows:\r\n1    9\"\r\n2    12\"\r\n3    15\"\r\n4    18\"\r\n5    21\"": "",
  "For each target:\r\n• Make a pile-in move.\r\n• Then, pick an enemy unit in combat with the target and roll a D3. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on that enemy unit equal to the roll.": "Por cada objetivo:\n• Haz un movimiento de aproximación.\n• Después, elige una unidad enemiga en combate con el objetivo y tira un D3. Con un 2+, inflige a esa unidad enemiga una cantidad de daño mortal igual al resultado.",
  "Roll a dice for each enemy unit that has been destroyed this battle. Add 1 to each roll if this unit used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn. If any of the rolls are a 4+, this unit is **full**.": "",
  "Spend 1 **relentless discipline** point. If this unit is in combat, no **relentless discipline** points are spent. The target's melee weapons have **Charge (+1 Damage)** for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "If this unit charged this turn, pick an enemy unit in combat with it to be the enemy target. Then, you can pick a friendly **Liege-Kavalos** within this unit's combat range to be the friendly target.": "",
  "Add 2 to casting rolls for this unit while it has not miscast any spells this turn. If this unit miscasts a spell, ignore the restriction that would stop this unit from casting any more spells this turn.": "Suma 2 a las tiradas de lanzamiento de esta unidad mientras no haya fallado el lanzamiento de ningún hechizo este turno. Si esta unidad falla el lanzamiento de un hechizo, ignora la restricción que le impediría lanzar más hechizos este turno.",
  "Subtract 1 from the Rend characteristic of weapons used for attacks made as part of that **^^Attack^^** ability that target any friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** units within this unit's combat range.": "",
  "Roll 2D6. If the roll exceeds the casting roll for the spell, then the spell is unbound, its effect is not resolved and that **^^Spell^^** ability cannot be used by enemy units until the start of your next turn.": "",
  "Roll a number of dice equal to the number of models in the target unit. For each 6, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target. If this unit has 3 or more models, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target for each 5+ instead.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn:\r\n• This unit's ranged weapons have **Anti-^^Faction Terrain^^ (+1 Rend)**.\r\n• Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of this unit's ranged weapons for attacks that target faction terrain features.": "",
  "Roll a D3 for each target. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll. Then, this unit can move 6\". It can move through the combat ranges of enemy units but cannot end that move in combat.": "",
  "If the target is more than 3\" from all other enemy units, apply the effect below. Otherwise, roll a dice. On a 3+, apply the effect below.\r\nRemove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again within 1\" of the target.": "",
  "If this unit is not in combat, pick a visible friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit that is in combat and has not used a **^^Relentless Discipline^^** ability this phase to be the target.": "",
  "This unit can cast this spell more than once per phase. Pick a visible unit wholly within 18\" of this unit that has not been picked to be the target of this spell this turn to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "Esta unidad puede lanzar este hechizo más de una vez por fase. Elige como objetivo una unidad visible totalmente a 18\" o menos de esta unidad que no haya sido elegida como objetivo de este hechizo este turno y después haz una tirada de lanzamiento de 2D6.",
  "This unit's **Balefire Braziers** are tokens. There are 2 **Balefire Braziers** for every 10 models in this unit. After setting up this unit on the battlefield for the first time, place its **Balefire Braziers** next to it.": "",
  "Replace your hero's melee weapon with **Ossified Talons**. Your hero has the **^^Wizard (1)^^** keyword and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** units\r\nYou can also pick a War Form for your hero.": "",
  "While this unit's **Mir Kainan** is on the battlefield, this unit has **^^Wizard (1)^^**, **^^Relentless Discipline (2)^^** and can be picked as the target of the 'Immortal Elite' ability as if it had the **^^Hero^^**\r\nkeyword.": "",
  "After that **^^Shoot^^** ability has been resolved, if all of this unit's attacks targeted the same enemy unit and this unit has any **Balefire Braziers** next to it, place 1 of those **Balefire Braziers** next to that enemy unit.": "",
  "If this unit is in combat and has charged this turn, pick this unit and up to 2 visible friendly **Kavalos War Chariots** that have charged this turn, that are wholly within 12\" Of this unit and that are in combat to be the targets.": "",
  "In your charge phase, if this unit is not in combat and there are any enemy units within 12\" of it, this unit must use the 'Charge' ability, and if the charge roll would allow it to finish within 1/2\" of any enemy units, it would do so.": "",
  "Replace your hero's melee weapon with **Guardian's Weapons**.\r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 8.\r\n**Designer's Note:** *We recommend a 50mm or 60mm base for this War Form.*": "",
  "Add 1 to hit rolls for this unit's combat attacks that target an enemy **^^Hero^^**. In addition, if that **^^Hero^^** is on a Path and has a higher rank than this unit, add 1 to wound rolls for this unit's combat attacks that target that **^^Hero^^**.": "",
  "Change your hero's Save characteristic to 3+.\r\nChange the number after your hero's **^^Relentless Discipline^^** keyword to 5.\r\nYour hero has the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** units\r\nYou can also pick a War Form for your hero.": "",
  "For the rest of the battle round:\r\n• Add 5 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's **Inda-Khaat**.\r\n• Add 3 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's **The Shield Immortis**.\r\n• This unit cannot use the 'Supreme Lord of the Bonereaper Legions' ability.": "",
  "Hide a dice in one of your hands or under one of two appropriate containers. Your opponent must pick one of your hands or containers. If they pick the one hiding the dice, this ability has no effect. If they pick the empty one, the target is automatically destroyed.": "Esconde un dado en una de tus manos o debajo de uno de dos recipientes adecuados. Tu oponente debe elegir una de tus manos o recipientes. Si elige el que esconde el dado, esta habilidad no tiene efecto. Si elige el vacío, el objetivo es destruido automáticamente.",
  "If this unit is wholly within 12\" of a friendly **Liege-Kavalos on War Chariot**, apply the effect below. Otherwise, roll a dice. On a 3+, apply the effect below.\r\n• Inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.\r\n• The target cannot make pile-in moves for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Roll a D3 for each target. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll. After this ability has been resolved, you gain a number of **relentless discipline** points equal to the number of total damage points allocated by this ability this turn.": "",
  "Change your hero's Health characteristic to 6 and their Move characteristic to 6\".\r\nYour hero has the **^^Wizard (2)^^** keyword, the 'Soul-guide' ability, and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** units\r\nYou can also pick a War Form for your hero.": "",
  "Pick 1 of the following weapon abilities for this unit's melee weapons to have for the rest of the turn:\r\n• **Anti-^^Infantry^^ (+1 Rend)**\r\n• **Anti-^^Cavalry^^ (+1 Rend)**\r\n• **Anti-^^Monster^^ (+1 Rend)**\r\n• **Anti-^^War Machine^^ (+1 Rend)**\r\n• **Anti-^^Beast^^ (+1 Rend)**": "",
  "Until the start of your next turn, each time an enemy unit within the target's combat range uses a command, unless your opponent spends 1 **rage dice** to use that command, the command has no effect, it still counts as having been used and the command points spent to use it are lost.": "",
  "Until the start of your next turn, each time the target is picked to use a **^^Core^^** ability, roll a D3. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll. If the target is destroyed by this ability, do not resolve the effect of that **^^Core^^** ability.": "",
  "Inflict D3 mortal damage on the enemy target. Inflict an additional D3 mortal damage on the enemy target if you picked a friendly target. Then, this unit and the friendly target (if any) can move 10\". They can move through the combat ranges of enemy units but cannot end that move in combat.": "",
  "If the target is an enemy unit, inflict D3 mortal damage on it. If the target is a friendly **^^Death^^** unit, pick 1 of the following effects:\r\n• Return a number of slain models to the target unit with a combined Health characteristic of up to 3.\r\n• The target has **^^Ward (5+)^^** until the start of your next turn.": "",
  "Add the **Monstrous Blades** weapon to your hero's warscroll.\r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 6\".\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 12.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^War Machine^^** keyword.\r\n**Designer's Note:** *We recommend a 105x70mm base for this War Form.*": "",
  "Pick a friendly **Kavalos Deathriders** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the ^^**Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved. If it is picked to do so, add 1 to hit rolls for the target's combat attacks for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Spend any number of this unit's **portions of truebone**. For each portion spent, pick 1 of the effects below. Each effect can be picked multiple times and the effects are cumulative.\r\n• Add 1 to casting rolls for this unit for the rest of the turn.\r\n• Add 1 to banishment rolls for this unit for the rest of the turn.\r\n• Gain 1 **relentless discipline point**.\r\n• Return 1 slain model to this unit.": "",
  "This unit can be picked to be the target of the 'Immortal Elite' ability as if it had the **^^Hero^^** keyword.\r\nEach time a visible enemy unit within 12\" of this unit is destroyed, roll a dice. On a 3+, this unit gains 1 **portion of truebone**. Each time a visible friendly non-**^^Beast Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit is destroyed, this unit gains 1 **portion of truebone**.": "",
  "While any of this unit's **Balefire Braziers** are next to an enemy unit, subtract 3 from the control scores of enemy units within that enemy unit's combat range.\r\nIf an ability would heal or return slain models to an enemy unit while any of this unit's **Balefire Braziers** are next to it, that ability does not heal or return any slain models to it. Instead, place those **Balefire Braziers** next to this unit.": "",
  "Add the **Titanic Weapons** and **Crushing Appendages** weapons and the 'Battle Damaged' ability to your hero's warscroll. \r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 8\".\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 16.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^War Machine^^** keyword.\r\n**Designer's Note:** *We recommend a 170x90mm base for this War Form.*": "",
  "If this ^^**Manifestation^^** was destroyed or banished this turn and the unit that summoned it is on the battlefield, roll a dice. On a 4+, set up this **^^Manifestation^^** again, wholly within 12\" of the unit that summoned it and more than 9\" from all enemy units. That unit has summoned that **^^Manifestation^^**. Add 1 to the roll if any enemy models were slain by this **^^Manifestation^^**'s combat attacks this turn.": "",
  "After that **^^Shoot^^** ability has been resolved, if all of this unit's attacks targeted the same enemy unit, roll a dice. Add 1 to the roll if this unit is wholly within 12\" of a friendly **Mortisan Ossifector**, and add 1 to the roll if any other friendly **Mortek Crawler** units picked that enemy unit to be the target of all of their shooting attacks this turn. On a 4+, the target has **^^Strike-Last^^** for the rest of the turn": "",
  "Spend a number of **relentless discipline** points equal to the target's Health characteristic. If the target is reinforced and has more than half of its starting models, spend an additional **relentless discipline** point. The target can use 2 **^^Fight^^** abilities this phase. After the first is used, however, the target has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn. In addition, the target cannot use **^^Relentless Discipline^^** abilities for the rest of the phase.": "",
  "Change your hero's Health characteristic to 7, their Move characteristic to 10\" and their Save characteristic to 3+.\r\nReplace your hero's **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^Cavalry^^** keyword. Change the number after your hero's **^^Relentless Discipline^^** keyword to 6.\r\nYour hero's **Nadirite Blade** gains **Charge (+1 Damage)** and they gain the **Kavalos Steed's Hooves, Teeth, and Barbed Tails** weapon.\r\nYour hero has the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** units": "",
  "Change your hero's Health characteristic to 12, their Move characteristic to 10\" and their Save characteristic to 3+.\r\nReplace your hero's **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^War Machine^^** keyword. Change the number after your hero's **^^Relentless Discipline^^** keyword to 6.\r\nYour hero's **Nadirite Blade** gains **Charge (+1 Damage)** and they gain the **Kavalos Steed's Hooves, Teeth, and Barbed Tails** weapon.\r\nYour hero has the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** units": "",
  "Roll a D3. Add 1 to the roll if the target is a **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^**. On a 2+, add an amount equal to the roll to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's **Razarak's Ebon Claws** for the rest of the phase, but while this unit is in combat with the target, all attacks made with that weapon this phase must target that enemy unit.\r\n**Designer's Note:** *If the target is a* **^^Wizard^^** *or* **^^Priest^^***, this ability cannot fail; however you still need to roll to determine the number of extra attacks it generates.*": "",
  "Roll 10 dice. For each 6:\r\n• Give the target 1 **necrotic withering** point.\r\n• Roll an extra dice.\r\nFor each 5+ on those extra dice, repeat the above bullet points. Then, do the same for each 4+, and then each 3+. Finally, for each 2+, give the target 1 **necrotic withering** point (do not roll any extra dice),\r\nAfter a roll, if the target has 8 or more **necrotic withering points**, it is automatically destroyed. Otherwise, after the last roll, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the number of **necrotic withering** points it has. Then, those **necrotic withering** points are lost.": "",
  "Pick a visible friendly **Mortek Guard**, **Mortek Triaxes** or **Mortek Crawler** unit that has not used an **^^Attack^^** ability this phase and is wholly within 12\" Of this unit to be the target. Immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved, the target can be picked to use either a **^^Shoot^^** ability as if it were your shooting phase or a **^^Fight^^** ability. If it is picked to do so:\r\n• Add 1 to hit rolls for the target's attacks for the rest of the turn.\r\n• The target's ranged weapons (if any) have **Shoot in Combat** for the rest of the turn.\r\n• If the target uses a **^^Shoot^^** ability and is not in combat, all of its shooting attacks must target units in combat with this unit.": "",
  "Your opponent must pick 1 of the following effects:\r\n**Pay the Tithe:** Your opponent must pick a unit in their army on the battlefield to be the target. They cannot pick a **^^Manifestation^^** or terrain feature. Then:\r\n• Inflict D6 mortal damage on the target.\r\n• Until the start of your next turn, the target cannot be healed, have slain models returned to it or be replaced.\r\n**Deny the Ossiarchs their Rightful Due:** Pick 1 of the following effects:\r\n• You gain 4 **relentless discipline** points.\r\n• Pick an objective you do not control. For the rest of the turn, add 5 to the control scores of friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** units while they are contesting that objective.\r\n• For the rest of the turn, add 2 to the Attacks characteristic and add 6\" to the Range characteristic of this unit's **Gaze of Death**.": ""
}
